<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending July 11 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PS</p>
<p>MONDAY, July 7</p>
<p>Low &amp; Bonar Plc	H    PFT	 24.5	23.0-26.0     26.2</p>
<p>				  DIV	  4.2	 4.0-4.2	 4.0</p>
<p>Tomkins Plc	    F    PFT	431.8     427.5-435.0   322.9</p>
<p>				  DIV	 11.3	11.2-11.5	9.95</p>
<p>				  EPS	 20.7	20.2-21.1     18.7</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 430.5 DIV 11.25 EPS 20.8)</p>
<p>TUESDAY, July 8</p>
<p>General Elec Co Plc  F    PFT    1,042.0   1,000.0-1,1155.0 981.0</p>
<p>				  DIV	 13.2	13.1-13.8	12.5</p>
<p>				  EPS	 23.7	22.6-26.5	22.6</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 1,039.8 DIV 13.28 EPS 23.4)</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, July 9</p>
<p>Dixons Group Plc     F    PFT	189.6     180.0-196.5    135.2</p>
<p>				  DIV	 10.6	10.0-10.8	 8.75</p>
<p>				  EPS	 30.0	27.5-31.6	23.7</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 188.0 DIV 10.5 EPS 30.4)</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
</text>
